# Local-only Bazel credentials template.
#
# Keep remote cache, RBE, platform, and toolchain defaults in .bazelrc. Copy only
# credentials into user.bazelrc when BuildBuddy needs to pull a private GHCR
# execution image for repo-owned RBE canaries or coverage.
#
# build --remote_exec_header=x-buildbuddy-platform.container-registry-username=<github-user>
# build --remote_exec_header=x-buildbuddy-platform.container-registry-password=<ghcr-token>
